YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds the first isolated Intelligence Gateway slice over existing Unified ownership. Public proposed catalog contains 34 logical tools, all runtime BLOCKED. Pure query preparation returns NOT_EXECUTED with no data/unknown coverage; deterministic research preparation returns NOT_SUBMITTED and no job/experiment. Runtime calls unconditionally deny without reading untrusted credentials/callbacks. No new ledger, engine, scheduler, authority or registry.\n\nBranch feature/intelligence-gateway-20261107. Publication HEAD e2fa604a6b39852db1075efc2ced07b8120801a2, tree0aa4032eef595f1dfb7dfc87513af8ea1d05d0a2. Tested source b1261c560922ac6fc255d79809759d7d06035f0a, tree9a8174b3b9470bdbcf969ab8ed4f284edcce8c92. Fresh committed exact-source workflow, CPython3.12.10 -I -S -B:16 unique tests PASS/0skip;1378 primary Git raw source files equal before/after. Initial missing-module RED and raw logs/receipt/index preserved in release/evidence/intelligence-gateway-20261107/. New Windows/Ubuntu workflow pinned to existing immutable action SHAs; terminal hosted results not yet claimed.\n\nReuse/design/identity matrix: docs/intelligence/gateway-design.md. Ownership: coordination/intelligence-gateway-ownership.v1.json. Raw user directive pinned under release/owner-directives/. No shared source modified. Stacked base is the existing Supervisor feature; this PR is not a main merge or approved runtime baseline.\n\nOwner A2: Gateway client identity/read disclosure/research quota-fencing/owned cancellation APIs NONE. A3: admitted query/registry/coverage/time APIs NONE. A6: authenticated artifact visualization seam NONE. Those replies are NOT full API ACKs; no private API or legacy endpoint used. Native Math remains BLOCKED after original single-use diagnostic; no retry.\n\nNot delivered by this slice: authenticated MCP/client registration, per-tool runtime RBAC, actual data query/job submission/cancellation, immutable experiment registry binding, observer/visualization adapters, actual-engine synthetic E2E or historical E2E, independent review and full terminal CI. No claims of full Gateway functionality. Physical deployment, provider sends, real orders, security changes and main merge remain prohibited. MASTER MISSION IN_PROGRESS / NO-GO.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T14:33:11Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T14:40:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"685041b95f7aafd09e9b0547e505aa78cf51a042","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/intelligence-gateway-20261107","ref":"feature/intelligence-gateway-20261107","repo":{"id":1434933263,"node_id":"R_kgDOVYdYDw","name":"unified-system","full_name":"YehorBabenko88/unified-system","owner":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language"